join character_overlay center [animation="Instant In"]
join character_poorGuy center
character_poorGuy: It is done!
character_poorGuy: The right to rule! All in this bottle!
character_poorGuy: At long last! MINE BIRTHRIGHT! AS THE GODS HAD ORDAINED!
Louie greedily drinks the potion
if {success} == true:
	character_poorGuy: YES! NOW WITH THIS! MINESELF IS...mineself is....no different.....
	Louie sighs and crumples to the floor
	character_poorGuy: Mineself does not blame you, alchemist. What fool would believe one could attain the right to rule through a concoction....
	character_poorGuy: The concoction was nothing more than a lure....to show greedy and desperate people like mineself how foolish they truly are.
	character_poorGuy: Foolish people like mineself...who had no right to rule...
	character_poorGuy: A part of mineself is relieved. If it was that simple to attain the right to rule then there could be no true king.
	character_poorGuy: Mineself's eyes have been opened...what a fool I was.
	character_poorGuy: What would mine father think if he saw mineself now.
	Louie looks down in shame
	character_poorGuy: Mine vain clinging to vanity and grandeur ends here. Mineself vows to be better.
	character_poorGuy: Mineself thanks you for not turning your back on mineself despite mine actions.
	character_poorGuy: If you could forgive mineself and humor me with a favour. Mineself would be ever grateful.
	character_poorGuy: Could mineself ask you to assis in the search for mine noble lady?
	character_poorGuy: She gleams like the sun! I may not be worthy now but perhaps...
	Louie continues to describe his "lady" with incredible zeal. He looks as if he has finally become honest with himself
else:
	set {gameOver} = true
	character_poorGuy: YES! NOW WITH THIS! MINESELF IS...mineself is....what is.....! Happening....!
	Louie's head starts to swell
	character_poorGuy: What have you done!?
	Louie's face contorts, a similar face turns it's ugly head at you
	character_poorGuy: Not again! MINE VISAGE! 
	character_poorGuy: LOOK AWAY PEASANT! MINE BODY IS NOT FOR THE LIKES OF YOU TO LOOK DOWN UPON!
	Louie covers his face and turns away in shame
	character_poorGuy: LOOK WHAT YOUR CONCOCTION HAS DONE!
	character_poorGuy: MINE DIVINE AND HEAVENLY APPEARANCE! RUINED, AGAIN! HOW HUMILIATING!
	character_poorGuy: TURN MINESELF BACK! RIGHT THIS INSTANT PEASANT! 
	You hear loud footsteps approaching
	character_oldMan: WHOA-HO! THERE! Did some sad bucko decide to shake the bee's trees and take the kingly rights potion?.
	character_poorGuy: CAN'T YOU SEE MINE SITUATION YOU UGLY WRETCH! LEAVE!
	character_oldMan: You's fell for the oooool' kingly potion bait, EH? Couldn't help it? AM I's RIGHT!
	character_poorGuy: WHAT ARE YOU IMPLYING WRETCH!?
	character_oldMan: SUCKERS LIKE YOU'S ARE EVERYWHERE. AND NOW THAT YOU'S TOOK DA BAIT! I'S GET TA BLAST YA!
	character_oldMan: TA SMITHEREENS!!
	character_poorGuy: YOU DARE! I AM A KING, DESTINED FOR GREATNESS! THE LIKES OF YOU-
	character_oldMan: Yada yada yada! SHOULDA READ DA TERMS AND CONDITIONS ON DA BACK PAGE, BUCKO!
	character_poorGuy: THERE WAS NO SUCH THING!
	character_oldMan: WHOOPS! Uhhhh....my bad! BUT ANYWAY!
	Godman Dave lifts his fingers to Louie
	character_oldMan: ET ABIERUNT! YA SOURPUSS! KABLOOEY!!!
	character_poorGuy: ARGHHH! IT SMELLS LIKE COW DUUUUUUUNG!
	Louie was blasted to smithereens
	character_oldMan: Terms and conditions kid' remember that. It'll be REAL important later on. 
	character_oldMan: Now dat dat's over. I gotta run kid.
	character_oldMan: The ladies 'rouind 'ere. Wait for no one. Not even ME! And I'm worth the wait!
	character_oldMan: HOLD ON LADIES! DAVEY IS ON DA WAY AND HE'S ALL WARMED UP! WHOOOO!
	Godman Dave runs off. Though Louie may be gone, it feels like he may return....
